From: Moraxyc <i@qaq.li>
Subject: [PATCH] nfsdctl: include <libgen.h> for basename() on musl

musl declares POSIX basename() only in <libgen.h>, not in <string.h>.

--- a/utils/nfsdctl/nfsdctl.c
+++ b/utils/nfsdctl/nfsdctl.c
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@
 #include <sched.h>
 #include <sys/queue.h>
 #include <limits.h>
+#include <libgen.h>
 
 #include <netlink/genl/family.h>
 #include <netlink/genl/ctrl.h>
